<title>UK: CREDIT LYONNAIS SETS WARRANTS ON PROPERTY BASKET.</title>
<headline>CREDIT LYONNAIS SETS WARRANTS ON PROPERTY BASKET.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd has issued one billion American-style call warrants on a basket of property stocks, lead manager Credit Lyonnais Securities said.</p>
<p>The basket consists of shares of Cheung Kong Holdings, Henderson Land, Concord Land and HKR International Ltd.</p>
<p>One basket is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$2.09232		PREMIUM	18.76 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.0669		 GEARING	3.48 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   07.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	26.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG		 MIN EXER LOT 20,000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  HK$2.3248</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
